  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Pentostatin is an anticancer drug used to treat hairy cell leukemia and chronic lymphocytic leukemia. It is an approved antineoplastic agent, but its use is limited and it carries a boxed warning; it is not authorised in the European Union.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q425470&quot;>Wikidata Q425470</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>pentostatin</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>L01XX08</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB00552&quot;>DB00552</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/439693&quot;>439693</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:27834&quot;>27834</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q425470&quot;>Q425470</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C11H16N4O4</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>268.273 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
